{"parentUuid":"06de8fd9-d9d6-4b59-9439-3f0637e58670","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_017Fz9PCA8qUtcAqg2iUNVrB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Да, есть несколько способов упростить:\n\n**1. Одна команда с `&&`:**\n```bash\npython3.11 -m venv backend/.venv && \\\nbackend/.venv/bin/pip install --upgrade pip && \\\nbackend/.venv/bin/pip install -r backend/requirements.txt -r backend/requirements-dev.txt\n```\n\n**2. Bash-скрипт** (создайте `setup-venv.sh`):\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nset -e\n\npython3.11 -m venv backend/.venv\nsource backend/.venv/bin/activate\npip install --upgrade pip\npip install -r backend/requirements.txt -r backend/requirements-dev.txt\n\necho \"✅ Виртуальное окружение готово\"\n```\n\nЗапуск:\n```bash\nchmod +x setup-venv.sh\n./setup-venv.sh\n```\n\n**3. Makefile** (если его нет):\n```makefile\n.PHONY: venv\nvenv:\n\tpython3.11 -m venv backend/.venv\n\tbackend/.venv/bin/pip install --upgrade pip\n\tbackend/.venv/bin/pip install -r backend/requirements.txt -r backend/requirements-dev.txt\n\n.PHONY: activate\nactivate:\n\t@echo \"source backend/.venv/bin/activate\"\n```\n\nЗапуск:\n```bash\nmake venv\nsource backend/.venv/bin/activate\n```\n\n**Рекомендую вариант 3 (Makefile)** — удобно и стандартно для Python-проектов. Проверьте, нет ли в проекте уже `Makefile`.\n\nКакой вариант вам нравится?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":607,"cache_read_input_tokens":57553,"output_tokens":676,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":607,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CZ6tbkpx5LuQ8Vj2UbPKv","type":"assistant","uuid":"75cef4f8-ead5-4c37-bc0a-c8136f1e4f38","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:08:22.310Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/user/github/